@startuml
hide footbox
actor "Browser" as BROWSER
box "First-Party Boundary" #D7F3E3
  participant "corda-rr.vercel.app" as S1
end box
note right of S1
  authentication: invite-gated session via signed JWT-style cookies
    (corda_invite, corda_terms); no user login/password
  authorization: server-side gating (geo/invite/terms/KYC);
    brokers Sumsub access token via GET /api/kyc/token
  dataSensitivity: high (KYC onboarding state, session tokens)
  owner: first-party
  notes: POST /api/auth/accept-terms uses Idempotency-Key header
end note
box "Third-Party Boundary" #F5F5F5
  participant "Google Edge/CDN" as S2
  participant "sumsub.com" as S3
end box
note right of S2
  authentication: none
  authorization: public asset delivery
  dataSensitivity: low
  owner: third-party
end note
note right of S3
  authentication: Sumsub WebSDK JWT access token (_act-sbx-jwt-...)
    minted server-side, passed into iframe; SDK adds X-Client-Id,
    accessToken, X-Session-Id, applicantId, device-fingerprint headers
  authorization: vendor-scoped to applicant via access token;
    refresh via expirationHandler re-calling /api/kyc/token
  dataSensitivity: high (PII / identity documents - KYC)
  owner: third-party (Sumsub KYC/identity vendor)
end note
BROWSER -> S1: REQ GET /vault?invite=demo
BROWSER -> S2: REQ GET fonts.googleapis.com /css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap
BROWSER -> S2: REQ GET fonts.gstatic.com /s/jetbrainsmono/v24/tDbv2o-flEEny0FZhsfKu5WU4zr3E_BX0PnT8RD8yKwBNntkaToggR7BYRbKPxDcwgknk-4.woff2
BROWSER -> S3: REQ GET api.sumsub.com /websdk/websdk.html?...
BROWSER -> S3: REQ GET static.sumsub.com /websdk2/static/entry.Cn8E8ZnQ.css
@enduml
